# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Reduce the sampling cost {#3-reduce-the-sampling-cost}"
msgstr "3. Kurangkan kos pensampelan {#3-reduce-the-sampling-cost}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`compute_local_scales` turns the shaded lightcone into a concrete PEC configuration. It prioritizes error terms by their bounded effect on the observable and truncates the least impactful ones until the requested `bias_tolerance` is reached. It returns scales for each error term: `0.0` for terms to ignore during mitigation and `-1.0` for terms that should be mitigated. The function also returns the resulting **sampling cost** overhead ($\\gamma^2$) and a bound on the **residual bias** incurred by the truncation.\n"
msgstr "`compute_local_scales` menukarkan shaded lightcone kepada konfigurasi PEC yang konkrit. Ia mengutamakan terma ralat mengikut kesannya yang bersempadan terhadap observable dan memangkas yang paling kurang berkesan sehingga `bias_tolerance` yang diminta dicapai. Ia mengembalikan skala bagi setiap terma ralat: `0.0` untuk terma yang diabaikan semasa mitigasi dan `-1.0` untuk terma yang perlu dimitigasi. Fungsi ini juga mengembalikan overhed **kos pensampelan** ($\\gamma^2$) yang terhasil dan sempadan bagi **bias baki** yang ditanggung akibat pemangkasan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting `bias_tolerance=0.0` mitigates every error term within the causal lightcone of the observable and gives a baseline sampling cost. Allowing a small bias lets SLC drop the low-impact terms and reduce that cost further.\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan `bias_tolerance=0.0` memitigasi setiap terma ralat dalam lightcone kausal observable dan memberikan kos pensampelan asas. Membenarkan bias kecil membolehkan SLC menggugurkan terma berkesan rendah dan mengurangkan kos itu dengan lebih lanjut.\n"
